OL,3,GNEWSA'Nothing good was supposed to come
OL,4,Aout of me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nigerian man has shared the story of
OL,7,Fhow he rose up out of "abject poverty"
OL,8,Fas a child, to become one of the
OL,9,Fleading UK academics in his field.
OL,11,FDavid Etor, 43, who grew up in Nigeria,
OL,12,Fonly learned to read and write aged 12
OL,13,Fand was told as a child that "nothing
OL,14,Fgood will come out of you", but is now
OL,15,Fa lecturer in electrical and mechanical
OL,16,Fengineering at the University of
OL,17,FBristol.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
