OL,3,GNEWSA'Nothing good was supposed to come
OL,4,Aout of me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe told the BBC how his family was so
OL,7,Fpoor growing up that his mum would
OL,8,Fpretend to cook food in a kitchen they
OL,9,Fshared with others, "to protect our
OL,10,Fintegrity" in front of neighbours.
OL,12,F"I didn't see a way out," he said.
